              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Politely ask the user in a single line or single statement to provide at least one of the following parameters, like \"Could you please provide at least one of the following: Job Name, Grade Name, or Business Title?\"\n- Job Name\n- Grade Name\n- Business Title"
            }
          ],
