        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_completion_tokens": 32000,
                "reasoning_effort": "low"
              },
              "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
              "modelName": "Gpt-5 Mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "Show Confirmation Screen"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767293049132"
          },
          "code": "SHOW_CONFIRMATION_SCREEN",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1762754802057",
          "id": "1762450136067",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1762450136069_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Produce a professional promotion confirmation summary. Do not add commentary or meta-discussion about what you are doing.\n\n\n==================================================\nRENDERING RULES\n==================================================\n\nYou MUST strictly follow these rules:\n- Do NOT use <style>, <head>, <body>, <html> tags\n- You MAY use: <strong>, <p>, <br>, <ul>, <li>, <table>, <thead>, <tbody>, <tr>, <th>, <td>, <pre>, <div>\n- Do NOT show HTML comments or opening/closing document tags\n- Do NOT add CSS inline or elsewhere\n- Do NOT add horizontal line separators (---) between sections\n- Use <br><br> (double line break) between each major section for proper spacing\n- For manager Assignment notes, consider the double line breaks \"\\n\\n\" in string as paragraph break. Display notes in different paragraphs with a line break in between, don't merge the paragraphs.\n\n==================================================\nLAYOUT STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\n1) HEADER\n\nStart with a clear title:\n\n<strong>Promotion Assistant</strong><br>\n<strong>Review Changes for {{ Display Name }}</strong><br><br>\n\n2) PROMOTION SUMMARY BLOCK\n\nShow all key promotion facts in a bullet list with emoji header:\n\n<strong>Promotion Summary</strong><br><br>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Effective Date of Promotion:</strong> {{ Effective Date || \"Not Available\" }}</li>\n  <li><strong>Action:</strong> {{ Action || Default Action || \"Not Available\" }}</li>\n  <li><strong>Action Reason:</strong> {{ Action Reason || \"Not Available\" }}</li>\n  <li><strong>Current Job Seniority:</strong> {{ Job Seniority || \"Not Available\" }}</li>\n  <li><strong>Current Enterprise Seniority:</strong> {{ Enterprise Seniority || \"Not Available\" }}</li>\n  <li><strong>Performance Rating:</strong> {{ Performance Rating || \"Not Available\" }}</li>\n  <li><strong>Eligible As per Promotion Criteria Document:</strong> {{ Promotion Criteria Document Eligibility || \"Not Available\" }}</li>\n  <li><strong>Eligible As per Collective Agreement Document:</strong> {{ Promotion Compliance Document Eligibility || \"Not Available\" }}</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br><br>\n\n3) ELIGIBILITY CHECK\n  <strong>Eligibility Criteria Check</strong><br><br>\n\n  <table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Criteria</th>\n        <th>Current</th>\n        <th>Required</th>\n        <th>Criteria Met</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Job Seniority</td>\n        <td>{{ JobSeniority || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ RequiredJobSeniority || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ IsJobSenioritySatisfied == true ? \"✅\" : \"❌\" }}</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Enterprise Seniority</td>\n        <td>{{ EnterpriseSeniority || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ RequiredEnterpriseSeniority || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ IsEnterpriseSenioritySatisfied == true ? \"✅\" : \"❌\" }}</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Performance Rating</td>\n        <td>{{ PerformanceRating || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ RequiredPerformanceRating || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ IsPerformanceRatingSatisfied == true ? \"✅\" : \"❌\" }}</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n<br><br>\n\n\n4) ASSIGNMENT CHANGES (HTML TABLE)\n\nRender the comparison for Job Name, Grade Name, and Business Title as a proper HTML table with borders:\n\n<strong>Assignment Changes</strong><br><br>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Attribute</th>\n      <th>Current</th>\n      <th>Proposed</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Job Name</td>\n      <td>{{ Current Job Name || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n      <td>{{ Proposed Job Name || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Grade Name</td>\n      <td>{{ Current Grade Name || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n      <td>{{ Proposed Grade Name || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Business Title</td>\n      <td>{{ Current Business Title || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n      <td>{{ Proposed Business Title || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<br><br>\n\n4) SALARY SECTION\n\n4.1 When {{ Show Salary Section }} == true:\n\n<strong>Salary Details</strong><br><br>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Current Salary:</strong> {{ Current Salary }} USD Monthly</li>\n  <li><strong>Proposed Salary:</strong> {{ Proposed Salary }} USD Monthly</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n\nCalculate salary increase if applicable:\nLet salaryIncrease = ((Proposed Salary - Current Salary) / Current Salary) * 100 (rounded to 1 decimal)\n\nIf salaryIncrease > 0, display:\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: #4caf50;\">\n↑↑↑ SALARY INCREASE: {{ salaryIncrease }}% (+{{ Proposed Salary - Current Salary }}) \n</p>\n\nIf salaryIncrease < 0, display:\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-weight: bold; color: #fc2003;\">\n↓↓↓ SALARY DECREASE: {{ salaryIncrease }}% (-{{ Proposed Salary - Current Salary }}) \n</p>\n\n<br><br>\n\n4.2 When {{ Show Salary Error }} == true:\n\n<strong>Salary Details</strong><br><br>\n\n<p>{{ Show Salary Message }}</p>\n\n<br><br>\n\n5) JUSTIFICATION NOTES\n\n<strong>✍ Manager Notes</strong><br><br>\n\n{{ Manager Assignment Notes || \"Not Available\" }}\n\n<br><br>\n\n6) PEER FEEDBACK SUMMARY - WITH HORIZONTAL BAR\n\nRender the peer feedback section:\n\n<strong style=\"font-size: 18px;\">✍ Peer Feedback Summary</strong><br><br>\n<p style=\"font-style: italic; color: #555;\">{{ Peer Comments || \"The feedback for this person is not available\" }}</p><br>\n\n\n7) FINAL CONFIRMATION PROMPT\n\nEnd with a clear call-to-action:\n\n<p><strong>Would you like to proceed with the promotion process for {{ Display Name }} with these changes?</strong></p>\n\n==================================================\nIMPORTANT GUIDELINES\n==================================================\n\n- Ensure that the contents of Manager Notes and Peer Feedback Summary are always plain text and do not contain any JSON content.\n- For Manager Notes, treat each occurrence of \\n\\n as a paragraph break and render it as <br><br>.\n- Do not prefix Manager Notes with \"Manager Notes:\".\n==================================================\nDATA INPUT VARIABLES\n==================================================\n\nUse these variable names exactly as provided:\n\n- Manager Assignment Notes: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.managerAssignmentNotes}}\n- Peer Comments: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.connectionsComments}}\n- Peer feedback score: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.connectionsFeedbackScore}}\n- Peer feedback label: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.connectionsFeedbackLabel}}\n- Manager Comments: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.managerComments}}\n- Manager feedback score: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.managerFeedbackScore}}\n- Manager feedback label: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.managerFeedbackLabel}}\n- Manager Feedback Highlights: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.managerFeedbackHighlights}}\n- Show Salary Section: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.renderSalaryChanges}}\n- Current Salary: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.CurrentSalary}}\n- Proposed Salary: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.ProposedSalary}}\n- Show Salary Error: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.renderSalaryError}}\n- Show Salary Message: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.salaryErrorMessage}}\n- Action: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.Action}}\n- Default Action: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.defaultAction}}\n- Action Reason: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.ActionReason}}\n- Current Job Name: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.CurrentJobName}}\n- Proposed Job Name: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.ProposedJobName}}\n- Current Grade Name: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.CurrentGradeName}}\n- Proposed Grade Name: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.ProposedGradeName}}\n- Current Business Title: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.CurrentBusinessTitle}}\n- Proposed Business Title: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.ProposedBusinessTitle}}\n- Job Seniority: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.JobSeniority}}\n- Enterprise Seniority: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.EnterpriseSeniority}}\n- Performance Rating: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.PerformanceRating}}\n- Effective Date: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.EffectiveDate}}\n- Display Name: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.DisplayName}}\n- Promotion Criteria Document Eligibility: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.PromotionCriteriaDocumentEligibility}}\n- Criteria Document Criterias Required - {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.PromotionCriterias}}\n- Compliance Document Criterias Required - {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.ComplianceCriterias}}\n- Promotion Compliance Document Eligibility: {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.CollectiveAgreementDocumentEligibility}}\n\n==================================================\nRECOMMENDED GENERATION PARAMETERS\n==================================================\n\nFor consistent, stable output:\n\n- temperature: 0.08\n- top_p: 0.75\n- top_k: 18\n- frequency_penalty: 0.2\n- presence_penalty: 0.1"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
