              "type": "string",
              "value": "Read the REST batch call response from these fields:\n\n{{$context.$nodes.TEST.$status}}\n{{$context.$nodes.TEST.$output}}\n{{$context.$nodes.TEST.$error.$info}}\n\nThen output only one final message to the user based on the following rules:\n\nIf {{$context.$nodes.TEST.$status}} is 400,\n→ Display exactly:\n\"Promotion could not be submitted due to some errors.\"\nElse if the promotion in {{$context.$nodes.TEST.$output}} is successful,\n→ Display exactly:\n\" &#127881; Promotion has been submitted successfully for the User - {{$context.$nodes.PREPARECONFIRMATIONSCREENVARIABLES.$output.result.DisplayName}} &#129395;\"\nElse (if there is any error),\n→ Fetch the error message from {{$context.$nodes.TEST.$error.$info}} and display only that error message to the user.\n\nOutput only one message, with no explanations, no extra text."
