            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "let batchPayload = $context.$variables.directReports\nlet normalizedArray = []\n\nif (!Array.isArray(batchPayload)) normalizedArray.push(batchPayload)\nelse normalizedArray = batchPayload\n\nlet payloadList = normalizedArray.map(item => {\n  // Only parse if it's a string\n  if (typeof item === \"string\") return JSON.parse(item)\n  return item\n})\n\nreturn payloadList"
