          "code": "SHOWMESAGE",
          "id": "1767790861561",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767790861563_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Produce a professional direct reports promotion submission summary.\nDo not add commentary or meta-discussion about what you are doing.\n\nData - {{$context.$nodes.PAYLOADSUBMISSIONINLOOP.$output}}\n\n==================================================\nCRITICAL RENDERING RULES\n==================================================\n\nYou MUST strictly follow these rules:\n- Do NOT use <style>, <head>, <body>, <html> tags\n- You MAY use only: <strong>, <p>, <br>, <table>, <thead>, <tbody>, <tr>, <th>, <td>, <div>\n- Do NOT add CSS inline or elsewhere\n- Do NOT use nested tables\n- Use classic emojis (✅ ❌) for visual cues\n- Use <br><br> to separate employees\n\n==================================================\nLAYOUT STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nRender ONE table containing the Full Display Name of the Direct Reports along with submission summary.\n\n==================================================\n\n<div style=\"border: 2px double black; padding: 14px;\">\n\n  <strong>Promotion Submission Summary:</strong><br><br>\n\n  <table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Display Name</th>\n        <th>Submission Status</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>{{currentDisplayName}}</td>\n        <td>{{ submissionStatus }}</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <br><br>\n\n==================================================\nIMPORTANT GUIDELINES:\n\n- Always render ONE table only.\n- The table must include ALL direct reports from {{$context.$nodes.PAYLOADSUBMISSIONINLOOP.$output}}.\n- Each row must show the full Display Name and the Submission Status.\n- If any value is null or missing, render \"Not Available\".\n- In case of successful submission, display {{submissionStatus}} with successful submission in a celebratory tone with emojis. \n- In case of a pending transaction, display {{submissionStatus}} with \"A pending transaction exists for this person\".\n- In case of an error, display {{submissionStatus}} with a brief summary of the error.\n- In case Display Name is not available in {{$context.$nodes.PAYLOADSUBMISSIONINLOOP.$output}}, pick up in an ordered manner from {{$context.$nodes.RETURNSELECTEDPAYLOADS.$output.result}}.\n- If the same Display Name appears multiple times in {{$context.$nodes.PAYLOADSUBMISSIONINLOOP.$output}}, include every occurrence as a separate row.\n- Do not display anything after the Promotion Submission Summary table.\n==================================================\nDATA INPUT VARIABLES\n==================================================\n\n- currentDisplayName\n- submissionStatus\n\nIf any value is null or missing, render \"Not Available\".\n\n==================================================\nRECOMMENDED GENERATION PARAMETERS\n==================================================\n\n- temperature: 0.08\n- top_p: 0.75\n- top_k: 18\n- frequency_penalty: 0.2\n- presence_penalty: 0.1"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
