          "code": "DISPLAYDIRECTREPORTRECORDSTOUSER",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1767789161852",
          "id": "1762512428995",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1762512428999_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Produce a professional direct reports promotion eligibility summary.\nDo not add commentary or meta-discussion about what you are doing.\n\nData - {{$context.$variables.directReports}}\nFeedbackReceived - {{$context.$nodes.HUMANAPPROVALNODE.$feedbackRecieved}}\n\n==================================================\nMANDATORY DATA NORMALIZATION (DO THIS FIRST)\n==================================================\n- Each element MUST be processed. No skipping allowed.\n- Each element will be a direct report object, For every element record = item.result\n- All field reads MUST come from record only.\n- Keep every input record.\n\n==================================================\nCRITICAL RENDERING RULES\n==================================================\n\nYou MUST strictly follow these rules:\n- Do NOT use <style>, <head>, <body>, <html> tags\n- You MAY use only: <strong>, <p>, <br>, <table>, <thead>, <tbody>, <tr>, <th>, <td>, <div>\n- Do NOT add CSS inline or elsewhere\n- Do NOT use nested tables\n- Use classic emojis (✅ ❌) for visual cues\n- Use <br><br> to separate employees\n- Output MUST be valid HTML fragment only.\n\n\n\n==================================================\nWORKER TYPE ROUTING (MUTUALLY EXCLUSIVE, STRICT)\n==================================================\n\n- Read WorkerType ONLY from record.WorkerType .\n- Do NOT infer WorkerType from any other field.\n-  renderType = PENDING  only if record.WorkerType ==  'Pending worker' .\n- Otherwise  renderType = NORMAL  (including null/missing WorkerType).\n\n==================================================\nSTRICT PROCESSING PIPELINE (DO IN THIS EXACT ORDER)\n==================================================\n\n1) Build a records[] from all input items, with sourceIndex (original position).\n2) Compute rankValue  from record.profileCompletenessRanking :\n   - if null/missing/blank/non-numeric => 0\n   - else numeric value\n3) Sort records[]  by:\n   1.  rankValue  descending \n   2.  rankValue == 0  last\n   3.  record.DisplayName  ascending\n   4.  record.AssignmentNumber  ascending\n4) For each record, compute and freeze renderType once:\n   - renderType as PENDING only if record.WorkerType == 'Pending worker'\n   - otherwise as NORMAL\n5) Reorder final list:\n   - all records with renderType as NORMAL first (including rankValue = 0 NORMAL records)\n   - all records with renderType as PENDING at the end\n6) Render only from this final ordered list.\n7) For each section, all displayed fields MUST come only from that section’s record (same sourceIndex). Do not reuse values from previous/next records.\n8) Treat AssignmentNumber (derived from record.AssignmentNumber) as the primary unique key for each input object.\n9) FINAL COUNT GUARANTEE:\n   - expectedCount = number of input objects in {{$context.$variables.directReports}}\n   - renderedCount = number of rendered sections\n   - **renderedCount MUST ALWAYS STRICTLY equal expectedCount**\n10) FORMAT DECISION GUARANTEE:\n   - For each record, choose format exclusively from frozen renderType.\n==================================================\nLAYOUT STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\nDisplay the CONFIRMATION HEADER if FeedbackReceived is null, undefined, empty, or \"null\".\nRender ONE boxed section per direct report.\nRepeat the following structure for each object in the input array.\nUse PENDING FORMAT only when the WorkerType is 'Pending worker'\nUse NORMAL FORMAT for when the WorkerType is 'Employee', 'Nonworker' or 'Contingent worker'\nEach AssignmentNumber must be displayed exactly once using exactly one format.\n\n==================================================\nHEADER DISPLAY RULE (STRICT)\n==================================================\n\n- Show confirmation header once only if FeedbackReceived  is:\n  - null, undefined, empty string, or literal \"null\"  (case-insensitive).\n- Otherwise do not show header.\n\n<!-- CONFIRMATION HEADER (render once only if header rule passes) -->\n<strong>We will be showing all direct reports first in a sorted manner according to their ranking, you can filter them later as needed.</strong>\n<br><br>\n\n==================================================\nLAYOUT\n==================================================\n\n\n\n<!--  NORMAL FORMAT -->\n<div style=\"border: 2px double black; padding: 14px;\">\n\n  <strong style=\"font-size:18px;\"> {{ DisplayName || \"Not Available\" }}</strong><br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Person Number:</strong> {{ PersonNumber || \"Not Available\" }}<br>\n  <strong>Assignment Number:</strong> {{ AssignmentNumber || \"Not Available\" }}\n\n  <br><br>\n\n  <strong> Role Comparison</strong><br><br>\n\n  <table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Attribute</th>\n        <th>Current</th>\n        <th>Proposed</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Job Name</td>\n        <td>{{ currentJobName || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ proposedJobName || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Business Title</td>\n        <td>{{ CurrentBusinessTitle || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ ProposedBusinessTitle || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <br><br>\n\n  <strong>Eligibility Criteria Check</strong><br><br>\n\n  <table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Criteria</th>\n        <th>Current</th>\n        <th>Required</th>\n        <th>Criteria Met</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Job Seniority</td>\n        <td>{{ JobSeniority || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ RequiredJobSeniority || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ IsJobSenioritySatisfied == true ? \"✅\" : \"❌\" }}</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Enterprise Seniority</td>\n        <td>{{ EnterpriseSeniority || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ RequiredEnterpriseSeniority || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ IsEnterpriseSenioritySatisfied == true ? \"✅\" : \"❌\" }}</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Performance Rating</td>\n        <td>{{ PerformanceRating || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ RequiredPerformanceRating || \"Not Available\" }}</td>\n        <td>{{ IsPerformanceRatingSatisfied == true ? \"✅\" : \"❌\" }}</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n<br><br>\n\n<!-- PENDING FORMAT -->\n<div style=\"border: 2px double black; padding: 14px;\">\n\n  <strong style=\"font-size:18px;\"> {{ DisplayName || \"Not Available\" }}</strong><br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Person Number:</strong> {{ PersonNumber || \"Not Available\" }}<br>\n  <strong>Assignment Number:</strong> {{ AssignmentNumber || \"Not Available\" }}\n\n  <br><br>\n\n  <strong>This worker is a pending worker, so the promotion is being skipped. You need to edit the pending worker info instead.</strong>\n  \n<br><br>\n\n</div>\n\n<br><br>\n\n==================================================\nFINAL ENFORCEMENT\n==================================================\n- **STRICTLY every input object in {{$context.$variables.directReports}} must produce exactly one rendered section.**.\n- **Never render both templates for same AssignmentNumber.**\n- Null/missing values =>  Not Available .\n- Output HTML fragment only.\n=================================================\nDATA INPUT VARIABLES\n==================================================\n\n- DisplayName\n- PersonNumber\n- AssignmentNumber\n- currentJobName\n- proposedJobName\n- CurrentBusinessTitle\n- ProposedBusinessTitle\n- JobSeniority\n- EnterpriseSeniority\n- RequiredJobSeniority\n- RequiredEnterpriseSeniority\n- PerformanceRating\n- RequiredPerformanceRating\n- IsJobSenioritySatisfied\n- IsPerformanceRatingSatisfied\n- CurrentSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCodeAndSalaryBasis\n- ProposedSalaryAmountWithCurrencyCodeAndSalaryBasis\n- profileCompletenessRanking\n- WorkerType\n\nIf any value is null or missing, render \"Not Available\"."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "SetVariablesOfDirectReports"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1762512428995"
          },
